msgstr ""
"Tizim haqida ma’lumot almashish buferiga nusxalandi va forumlarga "
"joylashtirilishi mumkin."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:526
msgid "System information uploaded"
msgstr "Tizim haqida ma’lumot yuklandi"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:526
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your system information was uploaded to %s. This link was placed in your "
"clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Tizim ma'lumotlari %s ga yuklandi. Bu havola vaqtinchalik xotirangizga "
"joylashtirilgan."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:528
msgid "An error occurred while uploading the system information"
msgstr "Tizim haqida ma'lumot yuklanganda xato yuz berdi"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:528
msgid ""
"Copy and paste the system information manually into a pastebin site like "
"https://pastebin.com."
msgstr ""
"Tizim ma'lumotlarini https://pastebin.com kabi pastebin saytiga qo‘lda "
"nusxalang va joylashtiring."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:624
msgid "Ignore this report"
msgstr "Ushbu hisobotga e’tibor bermaslik"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:640
msgid "Are you sure you want to ignore this report?"
msgstr "Ushbu xabarni e’tiborsiz qoldirishga ishonchingiz komilmi?"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:641
msgid "The report will be permanently ignored and will no longer be visible."
msgstr "Hisobot butunlay e’tiborga olinmaydi va endi ko‘rinmaydi."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:730
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The debug symbols are missing for %(program)s.\n"
"Please install %(package)s."
msgstr ""
"%(program)s uchun tuzatish belgilari mavjud emas.\n"
"Iltimos %(package)s o‘rnating."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:744
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The package providing %s could not be found.\n"
"If you want to generate a stack trace for this crash report, please "
"reinstall it."
msgstr ""
"%s ta'minlovchi paket topilmadi.\n"
"Agar Siz ushbu buzilish haqida hisoboti uchun stek izini yaratmoqchi "
"bo‘lsangiz, iltimos uni qayta o‘rnating."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:772
msgid ""
"The headers or binaries installed on your system do not match the code which "
"was executed during the crash.\n"
"They probably got upgraded since.\n"
"A stack trace is available in 'Local Files' but its content is probably "
"inaccurate."
msgstr ""
"Tizimingizda o‘rnatilgan sarlavhalar yoki ikkilik fayllar buzilish paytida "
"bajarilgan kodga mos kelmaydi.\n"
"Ular, ehtimol, o‘shandan beri yangilangan.\n"
"Stek izi \"Mahalliy fayllar\" da mavjud, ammo uning mazmuni noto‘g‘ri "
"bo‘lishi mumkin."

